сти, причем из воздуха, причем за спиной с кучей модификаторов, абсолютно никаких шансов даже тупо исследовать локации. Беги и рви жопу, не рекомендую от слова совсем", "timestamp_created": 1637489714, "timestamp_updated": 1637489714, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.535860419273376465", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103191824", "author": {"steamid": "76561198297464758", "personaname": "KLOFF", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sanloch/", "num_games_owned": 56, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 5792, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1554, "last_played": 1679127751, "avatar": "c8196508ba9280b1e46c0e307042e1ee6e55740f"}, "language": "russian", "review": "Good!", "timestamp_created": 1637479281, "timestamp_updated": 1637479281, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103191691", "author": {"steamid": "76561198323927001", "personaname": "Ada-Lara Wong-Croft", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198323927001/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 132, "playtime_forever": 1649, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 273, "last_played": 1759680069, "avatar": "b5801d8170ed61115ed71b355dcdfa3fc1352550"}, "language": "russian", "review": "После 3х лет как брал эту игру разработчики наконец-то её починили и я смог насладиться этим шедевром. Игра крутая. Смотрится реально как продолжение Left 4 Dead 2. Однозначно рекомендуется к прохождению.", "timestamp_created": 1637479106, "timestamp_updated": 1733660211, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.464074939489364624", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}]}